    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Friends Like These is an adorable two-player local co-op adventure that makes sure no-one player is more important than the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/ffaef4dad01cc865c635e006dcf15891.poster.avif?t=1743121258\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/ffaef4dad01cc865c635e006dcf15891.webm?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/ffaef4dad01cc865c635e006dcf15891.mp4?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Silly Co-Op Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! While cruising through space to Party Planet you\u2019ve been hit by an asteroid and crash land on Super Chill World. Your friends don\u2019t know they\u2019re on the wrong planet and have started the biggest party ever. It\u2019s up to you and your bestie to stop them from trashing the place by teleporting them back to the party bus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/1126deee8758d322a2a02f7a8a3c6f53.poster.avif?t=1743121258\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/1126deee8758d322a2a02f7a8a3c6f53.webm?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/1126deee8758d322a2a02f7a8a3c6f53.mp4?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Role Swap Till You Drop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both players control the same ship; one flying, the other shooting. The roles switch based on the part of the environment you are in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/6054b7166b23aaa31eee6435dc70dcf8.poster.avif?t=1743121258\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/6054b7166b23aaa31eee6435dc70dcf8.webm?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/6054b7166b23aaa31eee6435dc70dcf8.mp4?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match the colour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to send your friends back to the bus, you'll need to match your magical teleport bullet colour to their eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because we all see colour differently, you are able to change the important colours to help make it clearer for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/e0926efd383dab26dafd9097d218f761.poster.avif?t=1743121258\" width=746 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/e0926efd383dab26dafd9097d218f761.webm?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/e0926efd383dab26dafd9097d218f761.mp4?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Busy Friends Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry if you don\u2019t have anybody to play with, Busy Friends mode is perfect for you. There are two ways to enjoy single player. The hard way and easy way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard is perfect for going solo but keeping the same challenge that two players would feel, as your left and right hands argue for control of the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy controls are perfect if you just want to enjoy the ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Friends Like These is an adorable two-player local co-op adventure that makes sure no-one player is more important than the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/ffaef4dad01cc865c635e006dcf15891.poster.avif?t=1743121258\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/ffaef4dad01cc865c635e006dcf15891.webm?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/ffaef4dad01cc865c635e006dcf15891.mp4?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Silly Co-Op Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no! While cruising through space to Party Planet you\u2019ve been hit by an asteroid and crash land on Super Chill World. Your friends don\u2019t know they\u2019re on the wrong planet and have started the biggest party ever. It\u2019s up to you and your bestie to stop them from trashing the place by teleporting them back to the party bus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/1126deee8758d322a2a02f7a8a3c6f53.poster.avif?t=1743121258\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/1126deee8758d322a2a02f7a8a3c6f53.webm?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/1126deee8758d322a2a02f7a8a3c6f53.mp4?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Role Swap Till You Drop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both players control the same ship; one flying, the other shooting. The roles switch based on the part of the environment you are in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/6054b7166b23aaa31eee6435dc70dcf8.poster.avif?t=1743121258\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/6054b7166b23aaa31eee6435dc70dcf8.webm?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/6054b7166b23aaa31eee6435dc70dcf8.mp4?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Match the colour</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to send your friends back to the bus, you'll need to match your magical teleport bullet colour to their eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because we all see colour differently, you are able to change the important colours to help make it clearer for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/e0926efd383dab26dafd9097d218f761.poster.avif?t=1743121258\" width=746 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/e0926efd383dab26dafd9097d218f761.webm?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498890/extras/e0926efd383dab26dafd9097d218f761.mp4?t=1743121258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Busy Friends Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry if you don\u2019t have anybody to play with, Busy Friends mode is perfect for you. There are two ways to enjoy single player. The hard way and easy way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard is perfect for going solo but keeping the same challenge that two players would feel, as your left and right hands argue for control of the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy controls are perfect if you just want to enjoy the ride.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In this 2D couch co-op adventure, team up with a pal to save the world from the playful chaos caused by your shipwrecked party friends. Together you must share and swap controls, combining your abilities in the ultimate showcase of friendship.",
